因为我认为没有哪个医生愿意对 43 岁的男人说，好吧，我想就是这样。

00:37:24.633 --> 00:37:26.285
No one wants to say that.
没有人愿意这么说。

00:37:26.285 --> 00:37:30.184
They want to fight for you and try to do whatever they can.
他们想为你而战，并尽其所能。

00:37:30.184 --> 00:37:40.230
But you know, it's something my husband said to me before I, what I'm very grateful for is that we had time to talk to each other before he passed away.
但你知道，这是我丈夫在我去世之前对我说过的话，我非常感激的是，在他去世之前我们有时间互相交谈。

00:37:41.030 --> 00:37:47.349
And one of the things he said to me was, you know, he felt like his purpose was to have our child.
