Absolutely.
绝对地。

00:41:31.817 --> 00:41:32.622
Absolutely.
绝对地。

00:41:32.219 --> 00:41:36.219
Well, grief, you can't have love without grief.
好吧，悲伤，没有悲伤就不可能有爱。

00:41:36.219 --> 00:41:38.219
So it's the cost of it.
所以这就是它的成本。

00:41:38.219 --> 00:41:39.219
Yeah.
是的。

00:41:39.219 --> 00:41:40.219
Yeah.
是的。

00:41:40.219 --> 00:41:41.219
Yeah.
是的。

00:41:41.219 --> 00:41:42.219
It's the cost.
这就是成本。

