Like that doesn't, you know, it will never go away.
就像那样，你知道，它永远不会消失。

00:41:54.219 --> 00:41:55.219
Right.
正确的。

00:41:55.219 --> 00:41:58.219
Like I, you know, the love you have for a person will never go away.
就像我一样，你知道，你对一个人的爱永远不会消失。

00:41:58.219 --> 00:41:59.219
